{"overview":"یک درام پلیسی جذاب درباره مردان و زنان منطقه ۲۱ اداره پلیس شیکاگو که همه چیز را برای خدمت و محافظت از جامعه خود به خطر می‌اندازند. منطقه ۲۱ از دو گروه کاملاً متفاوت تشکیل شده است: پلیس‌های یونیفورم‌پوشی که به گشت‌زنی می‌پردازند و با جنایات خیابانی شهر رو در رو می‌شوند و واحد اطلاعاتی که با جرایم بزرگ شهر مبارزه می‌کند - جنایات سازمان‌یافته، قاچاق مواد مخدر، قتل‌های خبرساز و فراتر از آن.","tagline":"قواعد را بشکن. نه قانون را.","overview_en":"A riveting police drama about the men and women of the Chicago Police Department's District 21 who put it all on the line to serve and protect their community. District 21 is made up of two distinctly different groups: the uniformed cops who patrol the beat and go head-to-head with the city's street crimes and the Intelligence Unit that combats the city's major offenses - organized crime, drug trafficking, high profile murders and beyond.","tagline_en":"Welcome home.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":15,"y":2014,"poster":"/A1rwtojFg3ClDEs55RGDt6243sx.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":23,"y":2014,"poster":"/afq2obuEF6h1PTmK4Ayl3ePZuU7.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":23,"y":2015,"poster":"/r4JpxAZzVBu5ISbYZRNZypehVaN.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":23,"y":2016,"poster":"/3BudYVodgWVlSMFN0aCRsmJlBTU.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":22,"y":2017,"poster":"/2Jt1gCNhFoMCINekfMKzdg7PDq5.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":22,"y":2018,"poster":"/k6raSszteaRIwB7RImiYi4M2HPH.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":20,"y":2019,"poster":"/dmYkNvgSaztGUdkJi8jGz3HxNL5.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":16,"y":2020,"poster":"/OlPR1kctwXzSUJQkZINDDhNlHV.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":22,"y":2021,"poster":"/qEirT6JZKMexfSDaAOzVxFHpqgU.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":22,"y":2022,"poster":"/7gtp4lusk685hdmuEXMbYrmSQoY.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":13,"y":2024,"poster":"/mZObarMPF76PGVmwywQ7Ks4UFpR.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":22,"y":2024,"poster":"/2nHdAW7MUMuXMJO6ev0mFMhEq8P.jpg"},{